---
import BaseLayout from "~/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "~/data/site";
const updated = "30 April 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Engagement"
  description="The terms under which Johannes le Roux Coaching delivers coaching services — scope, fees, refunds, confidentiality, and POPIA-aligned data handling."
>
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-red">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 display-l">Terms of engagement</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">Last updated: {updated}.</p>

    <div class="prose mt-12">
      <p>
        These terms apply to coaching engagements with {site.legal.operator}, trading as
        <em>Johannes le Roux Coaching</em> (referred to here as "we" or "the Coach"). They are
        intended to be plain-English; if anything is unclear, ask before booking.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Scope</h2>
      <p>
        Coaching is delivered as one of the productised packages listed on our coaching page, or as
        otherwise agreed in writing. The deliverables for each package are listed against the
        package and form part of these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Fees and payment</h2>
      <p>
        Fees are stated in South African Rand on the coaching page. Paid packages are payable in
        advance via the checkout / invoice provided. The Founder Clinic introductory call is free.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Sessions, rescheduling and cancellation</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reschedule any session up to 24 hours before its start time at no charge.</li>
        <li>Inside 24 hours, the session is forfeited unless we mutually agree otherwise.</li>
        <li>Multi-session packages must be completed within six (6) months of purchase.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Full refund on the unused balance of any package up to 14 days after purchase. After that,
        refunds are case-by-case — contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we'll
        find a fair outcome.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Confidentiality and IP</h2>
      <p>
        We will treat all venture, financial, and strategic information shared during coaching as
        confidential. We are happy to sign a mutual NDA on request. You retain all intellectual
        property in your venture; any frameworks, templates, or written materials we provide remain
        ours but may be used freely inside your business.
      </p>

      <h2>6. No professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        Coaching is not legal, financial, tax, or investment advice and should not be relied on as
        such. For regulated advice, consult an appropriately licensed professional.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, our liability arising out of or related to a coaching
        engagement is limited to the fees paid for that engagement.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Privacy</h2>
      <p>Personal information is processed in line with our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes will be
        resolved in the courts of the Western Cape, unless we mutually agree to mediation first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
